 "text": "Hi, How are you today? Lots of old fashioned fun is back right now. Want show them the living room, or get them a cup of tea? Going for a walk and spotting birds they recognize is nice counterpoint. You can do noodle dish they agree with, and something fast they like. Then find a bakery for a yeast pastry, and go easy on the oil. Your noodle dish can go with a fruit sauce. Keep it simple, so your grandpa doesn't get a sugar high.",
